# Anchor gate comma-range fixture

## Question

Does one anchor display path carry multiple comma-separated line ranges?

## Answer

No. Multiple regions require separate anchor rows or the bare file path.

## Derivation trail

The test materializes live hashes and requires the comma-separated display path to fail closed.

Provenance: {{TODAY}} · sid deadbeef

